        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-4",
        "title": "提示工程的藝術 - 藝術風格第 4 部分",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "卡通繪畫風格的特點是角色和物體看起來超級愚蠢、誇張和色彩豐富，有大眼睛和有趣的臉。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-4",
        "title": "提示工程的藝術 - 藝術風格第 4 部分",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/The-Art-Of-Prompt-Engineering-Art-Style-Part-4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "提示：漫畫風格。",
